  "releaseNotes": "Additions:\nadd test for ro-crate reading of an additionalType reference next to a text (#662)\nadd ro-crate 1.3 context\nCheck row strings on xlsx reader cache hits instead of trusting the hash\nCompare Data fields in Equals instead of hashes\nBugfixes:\nfix ro-crate reading losing numeric property values, datasets not listed in root hasPart and datamaps of the arc datamap profile\nfix ro-crate reading failing on unknown contexts, root data entities not named ./ and files without name\nadd arc ro-crate context and fix ro-crate reading failing on context keywords, expanded term definitions and additionalType references",
